// The first fight (openspec/changes/enemy-mechs). Each wears a block-out skin over the stand-in
// (openspec/changes/blockout-enemies): crabs by default, a Pincher, a Bruiser and the Tyrant (owner, 2026-10-25: "only
// crabs for now, some missions will be human mechs, but crab mechs for the default"). Offsets are from the player's mech, in metres
// (x, z); the player's mech faces -z down its street at the start. Enemies wear a rust tint and
// carry light armour (55 %): raiders, not the player's equal. The Pincher a light 25 mm autocannon, the Bruiser a
// shotgun and the Tyrant a plasma cannon and a multi-lock pod (openspec/changes/weapon-kinds, multi-lock; survey G22: anyone carries every weapon). Their brain (cb-core::ai, after Mining Mike's autopilot) orbits at
// `range_m`, evades when hit, hops on its jets and backs off behind cover when badly hurt.
